data.comment:
EN: {0} QSOs were not delivered to DXKeeper this run. Click to show the file in its folder, import it into DXKeeper, then delete it. This count clears when the file is gone.

{1}
    NOTE: Tooltip once QSOs have failed. {0} is a count, {1} is the full path of the ADIF file - do not translate the path.

data.value:
Nepodarilo sa otvoriť {0}:

{1}

Použiť odkaz na priečinok a importovať súbor do DXKeeper odtiaľ.

data.comment:
EN: Could not open {0}:
{1}
Use the folder link and import the file into DXKeeper from there. NOTE: {0} is a filename, {1} is an operating-system error message. Do not translate either.

EN: Could not open the folder:

{0}
    NOTE: {0} is an operating-system error message - do not translate it.

EN: Nothing has been written to the error log yet:

{0}
    NOTE: {0} is the full path of ErrorLog.txt - do not translate it.

EN: Could not open ErrorLog.txt:

{0}
    NOTE: "ErrorLog.txt" is a filename - do not translate it. {0} is an operating-system error message.

EN: Could not open the help page:

{0}
    NOTE: {0} is an operating-system error message - do not translate it.

EN: INVALID: {0}
    NOTE: {0} describes what was wrong with a received datagram and stays in English - it is wire diagnostics that also goes to ErrorLog.txt.
    NOT TRANSLATED: left in English deliberately - either a do-not-translate entry, or the machine pass damaged it and was rejected.

EN: *** {0}: DXKeeper DELETED the original, the edit was not logged{1}, AND the edit could not be saved to {2}. Reason: {3}
    NOTE: As AlertReplaceLostQso, but the recovery file could not be written either - the QSO is unrecoverable. Keep the *** marker.
    REVIEW: the machine pass ran a product name into the next word and a space was inserted to separate them. Check that the wording around it reads naturally.

EN: Could not open the licence file:

{0}
    NOTE: {0} is an operating-system error message - do not translate it.

data.value:
Licenčný súbor nie je tam, kde by mal byť:

{0}

Tento program je zadarmo softvér podľa GNU General Public License verzia 3 alebo neskôr, a prichádza s ABSOLUTLY NO WARRANTY. Licenciu si môžete prečítať na adrese https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html.

data.comment:
EN: The licence file is not where it should be:
{0}
This program is free software under the GNU General Public License version 3 or later, and comes with ABSOLUTELY NO WARRANTY. You can read the licence at https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html NOTE: Shown when COPYING is missing next to the program - a broken install. {0} is a file path. Do not translate the URL or the licence name.
